  "description": "Spread holiday cheer with this adorable Christmas Pattern! A seamless digital paper featuring cute smiling Santa faces, friendly reindeer, red poinsettias, decorated Christmas trees, wrapped gifts, gingerbread cookies, candy canes, ornaments and holly on a clean white background.\nWHAT YOU GET:\n• 1 JPG file (JPG only)\n• 300 DPI high resolution\n• Seamless digital paper\nDESIGN THEME:\nA cheerful red, green and white Christmas pattern with Santa Claus, cute reindeer in scarves, poinsettia flowers, Christmas trees with stars, gift boxes, gingerbread men, striped candy canes and baubles — perfect for a playful festive look.\nPERFECT FOR:\nChristmas wrapping paper, scrapbooking, greeting cards, invitations, gift tags, fabric and textile design, wall art, home decor, planners, stickers, mugs, tote bags and holiday party decorations.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Spread holiday cheer with this adorable Christmas Pattern! A seamless digital paper featuring cute smiling Santa faces, friendly reindeer, red poinsettias, decorated Christmas trees, wrapped gifts, gingerbread cookies, candy canes, ornaments and holly on a clean white background.</p>\n<p>WHAT YOU GET:<br>\n• 1 JPG file (JPG only)<br>\n• 300 DPI high resolution<br>\n• Seamless digital paper</p>\n<p>DESIGN THEME:<br>\nA cheerful red, green and white Christmas pattern with Santa Claus, cute reindeer in scarves, poinsettia flowers, Christmas trees with stars, gift boxes, gingerbread men, striped candy canes and baubles — perfect for a playful festive look.</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR:<br>\nChristmas wrapping paper, scrapbooking, greeting cards, invitations, gift tags, fabric and textile design, wall art, home decor, planners, stickers, mugs, tote bags and holiday party decorations.</p>",
